{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/extras/f3faf9f66fd85abf8bd162f1a56a0a99.avif?t=1767588512\" width=1217 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Neeblarium</strong> is a calm, living simulation about cultivating tiny digital creatures called Neeblies and deciding what\u2019s worth preserving. You don\u2019t control Neeblies directly. You shape conditions, observe what emerges, and intervene only when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/extras/18aed268fd727ea9fc2c5c6a915ae618.avif?t=1767588512\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, families form. Lineages diverge. Rare traits appear. Some discoveries are fleeting. Others are worth saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Lab to capture traits you\u2019ve discovered and reintroduce them as new founders. Run multiple biomes as experiments, each telling its own quiet evolutionary story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world keeps moving whether you act or not.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An artificial life sim about attention, care, and making something last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your role in The Neeblarium:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish conditions for life within a running ecosystem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce eggs and observe Neeblies grow, adapt, and reproduce on their own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch families form and lineages diverge across generations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice mutations, rare traits, and subtle behavioral differences as they emerge naturally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a Lab to preserve discovered traits and reintroduce them as new founders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run multiple biomes in parallel, each evolving independently over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide when to intervene, curate, or simply let things run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape long-term outcomes, but the system never demands constant micromanagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can be hands-on, or almost completely hands-off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simulation doesn\u2019t demand constant input \u2014 but it does reward attention.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Colony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/a613d6a3499ecdb51eaa39d910511665852edf03.jpg"},{"name":"Keen Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/fe973098351128060226088c9d20033262c55528.jpg"},{"name":"Genetic Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/f22d6faa7b7f28766393ee8f09b10fd80edb0000.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Inheritance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/e8772f1ed97b4f64e3400fef0a6e7716ace34c5d.jpg"},{"name":"Balanced Ecosystem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/ef32504b7b8ee7d9012673d3acb6bb68ba589d83.jpg"},{"name":"Rare Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/3e0cbf684838d74270d7664a9cd5796459422e42.jpg"},{"name":"Exotic Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/43cd53c6987313aa8b497bf846e5f2f0edcbffca.jpg"},{"name":"Touched by Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/e318cbd5ad997b285dca474163b60309c80eef3d.jpg"},{"name":"Master Curator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/c0044f9fb11c17aff1079b74def8364cba5ee472.jpg"},{"name":"Field Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4068780/1d92331ce3fb96eca772ff78b4461d3cb3d7998f.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068780?t=1767588512","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/0f450c4426be99a33dbff259cf7c3ef487bb1827/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767588512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/4e23463992aff9ac9e44fb32b9a7a2b1835ca562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767588512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/4e23463992aff9ac9e44fb32b9a7a2b1835ca562/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767588512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068780/extras/f3faf9f66fd85abf8bd162f1a56a0a99.avif?t=1767588512\" width=1217 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Neeblarium</strong> is a calm, living simulation about cultivating tiny digital creatures called Neeblies and deciding what\u2019s worth preserving. You don\u2019t control Neeblies directly. You shape conditions, observe what emerges, and intervene only when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_